  "label": "audience description",
  "description": "The target audience is individuals who are familiar with or find humor in racially stereotyping Black children as primitive, childish, or 'leftover' like the last few cereal pieces. This audience likely includes people who consume internet memes that rely on dehumanizing analogies and who may not recognize the harmful racial implications of such content. The meme is designed to provoke laughter through offensive comparisons, targeting those who find such infantilizing and racially charged humor amusing or relatable, despite its deeply offensive nature.",
